msgid "Part of this change was not saved: it moves or changes a hidden key, shown as [redacted:…]. Type the real value instead."
msgstr "此更改的一部分未保存：它移动或更改了一个隐藏的密钥（显示为 [redacted:…]）。请改为输入真实值。"

